        "text": "The guests' disks were deleted by the update",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Updates do not touch them."
      },
      {
        "text": "A new kernel, and no driver built for it",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right. Rebuild it, or boot the old kernel."
      },
      {
        "text": "VirtualBox's licence expired",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It is free."
      },
      {
        "text": "The guests need new Guest Additions",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "The warning is about the host."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
